    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "label": "legend_0030_friend_39",
      "hash64": "1D012B99E9AD72D4",
      "text": "但是，我相信那些都是真的！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "label": "legend_0030_friend_40",
      "hash64": "1CE99A99E9999D90",
      "text": "按照這本書的話，\\n只要吃下５種秘傳調味料，\\r\\n不論受什麼傷生什麼病，都能治好！[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "label": "legend_0030_friend_41",
      "hash64": "1CE99B99E9999F43",
      "text": "實際上獒教父吃了上一種調味料之後，\\n牠原本冰冷無比的手腳\\r\\n變得稍微暖和一點點了喔。[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "label": "legend_0030_mastiff_04",
      "hash64": "CF1EEBA9FFB57CB6",
      "text": "…………",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "label": "legend_0030_friend_42",
      "hash64": "1CE99C99E999A0F6",
      "text": "啊，你吃完了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0006)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
